</div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Ironshield Brounce</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Clan_Ironhand\" title=\"Clan Ironhand\">Ironhand</a> gnome in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>Brounce can be encountered together with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wulbren_Bongle\" title=\"Wulbren Bongle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/25px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/38px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/50px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wulbren Bongle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png/25px-Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Wulbren_Bongle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wulbren_Bongle\" title=\"Wulbren Bongle\">Wulbren Bongle</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fulguro\" title=\"Fulguro\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Fulguro.png/25px-Portrait_Fulguro.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Fulguro.png/38px-Portrait_Fulguro.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Fulguro.png/50px-Portrait_Fulguro.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fulguro\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Fulguro.png/25px-Portrait_Fulguro.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\